  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"MongoQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.repository.query\"><code>MongoQueryCreator</code></a> from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a>, <a href=\"ConvertingParameterAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.repository.query\"><code>ConvertingParameterAccessor</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"类或接口 in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a>、<a href=\"ConvertingParameterAccessor.html\" title=\"类 in org.springframework.data.mongodb.repository.query\"><code>ConvertingParameterAccessor</code></a> 和\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"类或接口 in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，创建一个新的 <a href=\"MongoQueryCreator.html\" title=\"类 in org.springframework.data.mongodb.repository.query\"><code>MongoQueryCreator</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Modifies a criterion for the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_EMPTY</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_NOT_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_NOT_EMPTY</code></a> keywords. Make sure to apply\n<a href=\"../../core/query/Criteria.html#not()\"><code>negation</code></a> first for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_NOT_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_NOT_EMPTY</code></a>. For <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> properties, checks if\nthe collection size is 0. For <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> properties, checks if the value equals an empty string and\nfor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> and other types, checks if the value equals an empty document.",
      "translation": "修改了 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_EMPTY</code></a>` 和 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_NOT_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_NOT_EMPTY</code></a>` 关键字的判据。对于 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_NOT_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_NOT_EMPTY</code></a>`，请首先应用 `<a href=\"../../core/query/Criteria.html#not()\"><code>negation</code></a>`。对于 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>` 属性，检查集合大小是否为 0；对于 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>` 属性，检查值是否等于空字符串；对于 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>` 及其他类型，检查值是否等于空文档。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Modifies a criterion for the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_EMPTY</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_NOT_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_NOT_EMPTY</code></a> keywords.",
      "translation": "修改 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_EMPTY</code></a>` 和 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/Part.Type.html#IS_NOT_EMPTY\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type.IS_NOT_EMPTY</code></a>` 关键字的准则。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the target property of the comparison is of type String, then the operator checks for match using regular\nexpression. If the target property of the comparison is a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> then the operator evaluates to true if\nit finds an exact match within any member of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果比较的目标属性类型为 String，则运算符使用正则表达式进行匹配。如果比较的目标属性是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>，则当在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> 的任意成员中找到精确匹配时，该运算符返回 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Custom query creator to create Mongo criterias.",
      "translation": "自定义查询创建器，用于构建 MongoDB 查询条件。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the target property of the comparison is of type String, then the operator checks for match using regular\nexpression.",
      "translation": "如果比较的目标属性类型为字符串，则操作符将使用正则表达式进行匹配检查。",
      "count": 1
    },
